# Copyright (c) Todd Porter 1993
# Sega3D.WLD...the 3D glasses circuit in VR!
# I did this on a whim...Thought it may help out some to visualize the sega
# board.  However I'm not sure I got all the traces right myself <G>.
# If anyone would like a definate VR copy of the rend386 3D glasses board
# let me know and I'll put in the one I built...I set this one up from PCVR 
# sketches and wasn't exactly sure how it was set up but liked it better since
# it used less 'jumps' than mine.  Maybe it could help some of those
# who are having trouble building the circuit.  In any case let me know at 
# either C$erve 76505,1574 or (best bet) Internet so92332@gsvms2.cc.gasou.edu
# If you want to see the traces better select the parts and delete them.
# BTW I built the whole thing in NorthCad in a multiple .plg but broke it 
# apart to eliminate confusion then put it back together into a .fig file
# to allow rotation of the board without throwing everything out of place.
# Just click on the board and everything will rotate around it like the 
# pelvis of the metalman.

worldscale 1.0
hither     10
yon        1000000
start -7200,8000,-4162 -300,40,0 5
groundcolor 3
skycolor 1
screenclear 1
ambient 76

split 0,0,0 0,1,0   0  #board split

figure board 1,1,1  0,0,0 0,0,0 . . 256

area 100,100,100 Rend386_Circuit
area 100,-100,100 Rend386_Circuit


